<title>USA: Mosinee Paper Corp Q3 net up.</title>
<headline>Mosinee Paper Corp Q3 net up.</headline>
<dateline>MOSINEE, Wis. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.79		    $0.36</p>
<p> Net			  8,279		    3,792</p>
<p> Revs			81,761		   79,423</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.96		    $0.96</p>
<p> Net			 20,580		   10,084</p>
<p> Revs		     237,130		  226,672</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,483		   10,483</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income includes expenses, or credits, for incentive plans calculated by using the average price of stock at close of each fiscal quarter as if all such plans had been exercised on that day. For three mos ended Sept 30, these plans resulted in after-tax expense of $183,000, or $0.02 per share, compared to after-tax expense of $583,000, or $0.05 per share, for year-ago period. Prior year per share data restated for May 15, 1996, 4-for-3 stock split.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
